      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "```sh\nflavor=night\ncurl -fsSL --create-dirs -o \"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/btop/themes/living-code-$flavor.theme\" \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/living-code-theme/btop/main/living-code-$flavor.theme\"\n```\n\nThen pick it under *Options → Color theme*, or set `color_theme = \"living-code-night\"` in `btop.conf`.",
      "configuration": "See [btop's documentation](https://github.com/aristocratos/btop) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
